    "chunk_text": "ode swa gelicie \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hi \u00f0anon gewyrige. Hi eodon \u00f0a begen up to \u00f0am munte; & he sona ar\u00e6rde seofan weofoda, & lac geoffrode. & ISRAHEL bletsode, & \u00fea \u00f0ingc witegode \u00fee him gewissode God. He mihte geseon Israhel of \u00f0am munte \u00feanon. \u00d0a yrsode Balac wi\u00f0 Balaam, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ic \u00f0e het feccan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u mine fynd wyrigdest, & \u00feu nu Far \u00f0e nu ham: ic h\u00e6fde gemynt \u00f0e to arwur\u00f0ienne on \u00e6htum & on feo, ac God \u00f0e ben\u00e6mde \u00f0\u00e6s HIT stent on o\u00f0rum bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t Balaam swa \u00f0eah t\u00e6hte \u00feam cyningce hu he cuman mihte \u00fe\u00e6t he hi God wear\u00f0 \u00f0a yrre Israhela bearnum, & het Moyses ahon \u00fea \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6t man dydon. Moyses \u00fea het \u00f0a manfullan ofslean, ealle \u00f0a \u00f0e bugon to Belphegor. & \u00fe\u00e6r wurdon ofslagene mid swurdes ecge feower & twenti \u00f0usenda of \u00f0\u00e6s folces m\u00e6niu; & Godes God bebead sy\u00fe\u00fean Moyse, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Wrec Israhela bearn on \u00f0am Madianitiscum & ofslea\u00fe hi, for MOYSES \u00f0a sende sona twelf \u00f0usenda gew\u00e6pnodra manna, to \u00f0am wige caflice. & hi \u00f0a ferdon & \u00f0\u00e6t folc ofslogon, & \u00feone cyningc Balac & Balaam samod; & \u00f0\u00e6t land aweston & Moyses \u00f0a yrsode; & axode hwi hi heoldon \u00f0a wifmen to life, \u00f0e hi forl",
